      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "flow_za",
      "originalText": "📸 Upload flow\n1. Guest → POST /api/upload/presigned\n2. Browser PUTs file straight to S3/R2\n3. POST /api/photo saves metadata (PG)\n4. autoApprove? → emit photo.approved\n5. SSE pushes photo to Live Wall\n6. Debounced stats → Admin stream",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "id": "t_zb",
      "text": "📸 Upload flow\n1. Guest → POST /api/upload/presigned\n2. Browser PUTs file straight to S3/R2\n3. POST /api/photo saves metadata (PG)\n4. autoApprove? → emit photo.approved\n5. SSE pushes photo to Live Wall\n6. Debounced stats → Admin stream",
