      "containerId": "rt_zg",
      "originalText": "⚡ Why SSE (not WebSockets)?\n• One-way server → client is enough\n• Plain HTTP: works behind Railway proxy\n• EventSource auto-reconnects\n• Heartbeats + shutdown event on deploy",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "id": "t_zh",
      "text": "⚡ Why SSE (not WebSockets)?\n• One-way server → client is enough\n• Plain HTTP: works behind Railway proxy\n• EventSource auto-reconnects\n• Heartbeats + shutdown event on deploy",
