      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "perf_zm",
      "originalText": "🚀 Burst protection (50 uploads at once)\n• EventCache: 50 event reads → 1 DB hit\n• Debouncer: 50 stats queries → 1\n• Throttler: 10 uploads/min per IP\n• Connection cap: 200 SSE / event",
